WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Choose an Operation. Addition combines. Subtraction finds a difference. Multiplication makes equal groups. Division shares equally.
Read the problem before choosing an operation.

2
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Addition. Align digits by place value. Add from the ones column and regroup when needed.
245 + 378 = 623

3
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Subtraction. Regroup carefully across zeros. Check a subtraction answer by adding it back.
5,000 - 1,287 = 3,713

4
00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Multiplication. Break a number into easier parts, then add the products.
24 x 5 = (20 x 5) + (4 x 5) = 120

5
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:15.000
Division and Checking. Multiplication and division are inverse operations.
120 / 5 = 24. Check: 24 x 5 = 120.
